- [x] Don Knuth's [$$\TeX$$](https://www.iconoclasts.blog/joe/triple-products.pdf) /カーンアカデミー's [$$\KaTeX$$](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KaTeX) 数学、物理学、化学のサポート:

```math
\ce{ Zn^2+ <=>[\ce{+ 2OH-}][\ce{+ 2H+}]$\underset{\text{amphoteric hydroxide}}{\ce{Zn(OH)2 v}}$<=>C[+2OH-][{+ 2H+}]$\underset{\text{tetrahydroxozincate}}{\ce{[Zn(OH)4]^2-}}$ }
